{
  "hitPhysics": {
    "_about": "HITPHYS v1 (lane HITPHYS): live hit physics. PRESENTATION ONLY, read by Scripts/Physics/HitPhysics.cs and applied inside HitReact (partial ragdoll of the LIVING fighters). Nothing here is read by the 60 Hz sim; simhash identical ON/OFF. A landed blow = a hit TYPE (move id -> type; attacker forceType: Pitborn maul, Sobek claw) x the victim FIGHTER row (massKg -> (refMassKg/massKg)^massExponent, reactMul, blendMul) x the attacker's punch x the CLASS (light/heavy/counter) x the ZONE (physics.json hit.rows head/torso/arms/legs when zoneRows). Per type: impulse/twist/lift/dip multipliers, blend = share of the proxy pose shown (0.2-0.5), holdS + backS in seconds (total with the row ease kept in durMinS..durMaxS = 0.15-0.35 s), atPoint = push at the blow point (thrust = sharp linear), pointLateralM = off-axis point so a slash gets torque along the swing, extra = whole-body pushes (maul/claw). Stagger step: fighter.step with score (type impulse x class impulse x punch x mass scale x stepWeight) >= stepThreshold throws the far leg out along the blow. Blocks: clash kinds x fighter clashMul x mass x attacker punch scale the arm recoil of physics.json clash. enabled=false or file missing = HitReact exactly as before. QA: edit here AND in StreamingAssets (apply_hitphys.py --off / --on does both).",
    "enabled": true,
    "knockback": {
      "_about": "KNOCKBACK v1 (lane KNOCKBACK): SIM push of the victim root on a clean hit (feeds DuelFighter.SetKnock, so Stagger/Down slide it through the CharacterController: zone colliders stop it). enabled=false = nothing changes (decay stays 0.88). metres = classes[counter|heavy|light].dist x (move.knockback/refKnockbackMps) x attacker scale x (refMassKg/victimMassKg)^massExponent (clamped) x resist[victim character id] x poise knockMul, capped at maxM, cut to the room left (arena_limits rect, play area, stair width, wall sphere-cast, ground ray every probeStepM). resist: higher = pushed further, 0 = planted; '*' = default. massKg comes from hitPhysics.fighters. Shoves keep shove.json (skipShove).",
      "enabled": false,
      "skipShove": true,
      "clampArena": true,
      "clampWalls": true,
      "clampGround": true,
      "log": false,
      "refKnockbackMps": 4.0,
      "decay": 0.88,
      "maxM": 1.2,
      "minPushM": 0.02,
      "minSlideTicks": 6,
      "refMassKg": 66.7,
      "massExponent": 0.5,
      "minMassScale": 0.3,
      "maxMassScale": 1.6,
      "probeSkinM": 0.05,
      "probeStepM": 0.1,
      "probeUpM": 0.5,
      "probeDropM": 0.6,
      "probeChestM": 0.9,
      "defaultClass": "light",
      "defaultResist": "*",
