    "hitDir": {
      "_about": "HITDIR v1: blow direction -> small directional partial reaction (HitReactDir.cs). enabled=false = current behaviour. Blow vector is ATTACKER-local (x right, y up, z forward) per move id (character row, then id, then contains). Turned into the victim frame: lat > 0 = blow travels toward the victim's right. Part rows = DEGREES per unit of lateral / vertical (down = nod) / depth (into the chest = head back); yaw about up, roll about forward (negative rollLat = lean WITH the blow), side toward|away relative to the side the blow travels toward. All angles x class mul x fighter mul x mass mul x attacker punch, each component capped at maxDeg. flipLateral -1 mirrors everything if the proof shows the wrong side. Timing = ease + hold + back seconds x class timeMul.",
